1
00:00:09,885 --> 00:00:12,346
Why are you
being so nervous?

2
00:00:12,471 --> 00:00:14,097
It's me who
made the mistake

3
00:00:14,223 --> 00:00:15,223
No

4
00:00:19,102 --> 00:00:21,813
Should you not
go see Shin Yoo-il?

5
00:00:23,315 --> 00:00:25,526
Yoo-il told me
to see you first

6
00:00:27,945 --> 00:00:29,529
What happened?

7
00:00:29,655 --> 00:00:32,032
Hello everyone
long time no see

8
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:32,908
[Hell TV]
[Neighborhood Gym Tour]

9
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:34,034
Oh my

10
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:36,039
[Isn't that Shin Yoo-il?
Wait, it's really him!]

11
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,539
I asked him when he'd
break up with you

12
00:00:38,789 --> 00:00:40,332
saying it was wrong
from the beginning

13
00:00:41,458 --> 00:00:42,876
Then, he asked me back

14
00:00:45,128 --> 00:00:46,838
if I was obsessed
with you

15
00:00:46,964 --> 00:00:48,590
because of what
happened in the past

16
00:00:50,342 --> 00:00:51,342
What happened
in the past?

17
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,680
Back then…

18
00:00:57,975 --> 00:00:58,975
when you

19
00:01:00,811 --> 00:01:02,229
were trapped
in a warehouse

20
00:01:05,232 --> 00:01:06,775
the kid who stayed
with you there

21
00:01:08,944 --> 00:01:10,195
was Shin Yoo-il

22
00:01:12,572 --> 00:01:14,741
The kid who used to come
to see you every day…

23
00:01:14,866 --> 00:01:15,866
It was

24
00:01:18,829 --> 00:01:19,829
Shin Yoo-il

25
00:01:21,373 --> 00:01:23,458
I knew you were
misunderstanding

26
00:01:25,377 --> 00:01:26,377
I felt guilty

27
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:30,924
every time
I was bragging

28
00:01:32,259 --> 00:01:33,802
that I saved your life

29
00:01:37,556 --> 00:01:38,556
But I lied

30
00:01:40,392 --> 00:01:42,602
to stay next to you
using that

31
00:01:43,729 --> 00:01:44,729
I mean

32
00:01:47,649 --> 00:01:49,067
Shin Yoo-il wasn't wrong

33
00:01:49,192 --> 00:01:53,280
He stayed with me
until I was saved

34
00:01:53,405 --> 00:01:54,405
No, that's not true…
